{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>紅磡船景街黃埔天地黃埔號，今日（13日）早上7時41分發生火警。據報有食肆廚房爐頭失火，冒出大量濃煙，職員報警，同時驚動途人報案。消防員到場開一喉一煙帽隊灌救，23分鐘後救熄，救護車亦在場戒備，事件中無人受傷。</p><p>從網上影片可見，黃埔號頂部冒濃煙，席捲半空，多輛消防車到達現場。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃埔號頂部冒濃煙，席捲半空。（黃埔好東西圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142403426160742400920834.jpeg/OuPO37GHIEKibmMJsSMpGmyqXTLoFqA7CTLJeQkyyXk\"/><figcaption>黃埔號頂部冒濃煙，席捲半空。（黃埔好東西圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃埔號頂部冒濃煙。（黃埔人•紅磡人•土瓜灣人/Kevin Choi相片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142403428677455872685192.png/MCBWWlMRnEJ7UuEPjKAFg2-yo6AjNdfmOeJ1nznidZ8\"/><figcaption>黃埔號頂部冒濃煙。（黃埔人•紅磡人•土瓜灣人/Kevin Choi相片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃埔號有食肆冒煙，消防開一喉一煙帽隊灌救。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142381669093740544230591.jpeg/pK2LdTlaBiF9v3XrUg_Ozqk9BaZTTiJOepP6BXqT-gU\"/><figcaption>黃埔號有食肆冒煙，消防開一喉一煙帽隊灌救。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃埔號有食肆冒煙。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142381683774328832960834.jpeg/1WwldHNrxO6VBkJmKq55fWVDMH3555BmB4v8iQeL_Ik\"/><figcaption>黃埔號有食肆冒煙。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃埔號有食肆冒煙。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142381680846573568417960.jpeg/w6EL7-MeMWGHID_KKsWhEXfOG5MS22duQAv3AUAL9wE\"/><figcaption>黃埔號有食肆冒煙。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場處理。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142381677633605632384927.jpeg/DzsMOWfIui4_ipC9MOhG2v2NvYigMyjsv_KJsL_yibA\"/><figcaption>消防員在場處理。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防在場檢視。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142381674689073152781524.jpeg/LYG7zPRQI9V5G-01uvcX4PGqGHJXBCAiviuyb74rsm8\"/><figcaption>消防在場檢視。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員進入商場內調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142381671916507136593728.jpeg/-NH2PwuEg3WZvYkIxSvhcr-QUXJnyQ2dHnVpWh51aVo\"/><figcaption>人員進入商場內調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-13T01:58:06.391182+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}